			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["69DC68C386D88E9A"]
			description: ["Each people carries a gift and a burden: Dwarves dig, Elves dodge, Orcs smash, Halflings stumble into luck. Your choice is permanent: there is no cheap respec for blood."]
