			description: ["Warrior, Berserker, Guardian, Paladin, Cleric, Druid, Necromancer, Blood Mage, Elementalist, Arcanist, Spellblade, Ranger, Rogue, Wanderer. Pick the one that sounds like you and walk to its first gate."]
